]},{"nodeId":721580105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":3337484282,"text":"君が扉みたいなものを通ったら消失したって、大祐が言ってたけど。","nextNodeIds":[721580106]},{"nodeId":721580106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":3931699730,"text":"あの扉はなんだろう？変ね…","nextNodeIds":[721580107]},{"nodeId":721580107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":2704369106,"text":"上で何があったの？","nextNodeIds":[721580108]},{"nodeId":721580108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":1991169138,"text":"僕と悦子が下にいた時、上から突然大きな音が聞こえたんだ。まるで…雷のような…","nextNodeIds":[721580109]},{"nodeId":721580109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":4191025890,"text":"でも、雷は収まったはず…","nextNodeIds":[721580110]},{"nodeId":721580110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1378009106,"text":"事の経緯は…","nextNodeIds":[721580111]},{"nodeId":721580111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":3761396242,"text":"石が空中に浮かんで、土台を作った…","nextNodeIds":[721580112]},{"nodeId":721580112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":1410354834,"text":"そんな…前代未聞だ。セイライ島にこんな自然現象があったなんて…","nextNodeIds":[721580113]},{"nodeId":721580113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":1622848602,"text":"そんなの…自然現象なわけないでしょ…","nextNodeIds":[721580114]},{"nodeId":721580114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":1325893090,"text":"どう考えても…普通じゃないわ…","nextNodeIds":[721580115,721580116]},{"nodeId":721580115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4250635458,"text":"確かに。","nextNodeIds":[721580117]},{"nodeId":721580117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":618091570,"text":"でも、それが何の現象かはともかく、セイライ島の雷も収まったし、我々の任務も終わった…","nextNodeIds":[721580118]},{"nodeId":721580118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3516371282,"text":"奇妙な羽毛について…","nextNodeIds":[721580119]},{"nodeId":721580119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":3694983162,"text":"この羽毛…大祐、これを見て。","nextNodeIds":[721580120]},{"nodeId":721580120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":3480256674,"text":"どれどれ…","nextNodeIds":[721580121]},{"nodeId":721580121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":1910459474,"text":"ごめん、僕もこの羽毛がどこから来たのか分からない。","nextNodeIds":[721580122]},{"nodeId":721580122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":3751334570,"text":"この羽毛の模様と質感、どれも僕の知ってる鳥類とは違うものだ。","nextNodeIds":[721580123]},{"nodeId":721580123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":182236482,"text":"それにこの羽毛の大きさ、比率をもとに計算したら、この鳥はあの空にある石台と同じくらいの大きさになる。","nextNodeIds":[721580124]},{"nodeId":721580124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":2604630034,"text":"この羽毛は大事なもの？もし詳しいことが知りたいのなら、冒険者協会で依頼を出してみたら？手がかりが見つかるかもしれないわよ。","nextNodeIds":[721580125,721580126]},{"nodeId":721580125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1416109018,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[721580127]},{"nodeId":721580127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":1133991418,"text":"そう、じゃあ…今回はありがとう、冒険者。私と大祐は協会に戻って報告してくる。","nextNodeIds":[721580128]},{"nodeId":721580128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":3137417362,"text":"そうだ、これを報酬として受け取って。あまり多くはないけど…手助けしてくれたお礼よ。","nextNodeIds":[721580129]},{"nodeId":721580129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":4077445226,"text":"大祐、協会へ戻る準備をするわよ。","nextNodeIds":[721580130]},{"nodeId":721580130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":3876474218,"text":"その、悦子…その前にあの神社に行って、「寝子」さまを見に行こうよ。","nextNodeIds":[721580131]},{"nodeId":721580131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":899566546,"text":"あのねぇ…","nextNodeIds":[721580132]},{"nodeId":721580132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","textMapHash":803265194,"text":"言葉を喋る猫なんだよ？喋る猫！","nextNodeIds":[721580133]},{"nodeId":721580133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","textMapHash":3371897554,"text":"まったくあんたは…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721580126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":174865474,"text":"もう少し調べてみる…","nextNodeIds":[721580127]},{"nodeId":721580116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":988619666,"text":"その通り。","nextNodeIds":[721580117]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7215801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["3180"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7215801],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3180,"speakerName":"悦子","count":14},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3181,"speakerName":"大祐","count":12},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":7}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[172158],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2510779142,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_RANK_ZERO_WQ","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{